# A permanent that is not a creature can still explore (CR 701.44a, the rulings), but it is not "a creature you control": Twists and Turns doesn't replace
# its explore and Merfolk Cave-Diver doesn't trigger. With Cenote Scout's "it explores" on the stack, Bot1 flashes Swift Reconfiguration onto the Scout,
# which becomes a Vehicle artifact and no longer a creature. The Scout explores with no scry first: Lightning Bolt, a nonland card, is revealed, the Scout
# gets its +1/+1 counter all the same, and Bot1 leaves the Bolt on top. The Diver stays a 2/4.

